    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player controls Terentius Duval in this open world third person shooter adventure game. Player mission is to hang around and find money bags in big open world. Finding money bags gives player steam achievements and there is totally 12 hidden money bags. Open world include several places like beach, city, industrial area, military area, desert etc. Player need avoid npc:s which can shoot\u00a0 Terentius Duval, if Duval uses weapons against them. There is several different weapons like rifle, shotgun etc. Player can also use vehicles to move to another place. Open world contains also ncps walking and also car npc which just randomly drives at different places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After player dies he respawn to some locations.\u00a0 So can you be the hero and find all money bags in this parody from GTA games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 hidden money bags which gives achievements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big open world which contains different areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >car to drive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >npc walking. Some guys may shooting with different weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >car npc driving randomly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several different weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
